:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>暴雨冲刷着雾角栈桥中段的铸铁系缆桩，<<else>>退潮后的雾角栈桥中段铸铁系缆桩旁，<</if>>桩座底部的排水石槽里卡着一只涂了防锈红丹漆的黄铜航海浮筒，桩耳上挂着一圈备用麻绳与一把撬牡蛎的扁铁铲。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_11 is 1>>
雾角栈桥中段的黄铜航海浮筒今日已取出查验，潮水顺石槽流淌。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-11">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬壳取浮筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-11">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11300 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_11 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_11_rew")>><<money 340>>牡蛎壳应声崩落，你取出浮筒里封存的旧港引航员备用银币与潮汐签。<<else>>石槽底部清理得干干净净，排水畅通无阻。<</if>><span class="green">你在雾角栈桥石槽中起出了黄铜航海浮筒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	湿滑海藻让扁铁铲打滑，浪花拍湿了你的鞋尖。<span class="red">你退上半级石阶甩干水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "吊起浮筒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-11">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_11 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>麻绳双套结牢牢箍住筒身，你轻松提上浮筒，连同底下的防水铜罗盘件一并收好。<<else>>双套结手法娴熟利落，浮筒表面红丹漆分毫无损。<</if>><span class="green">你凭水手绳结巧劲完整吊出了航海浮筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹晃了垂下的绳圈，第一下没能套准浮筒耳环。<span class="red">你收拢麻绳重新比对位置。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雾笼罩着守塔人旧居外侧的青石晒盐台，<<else>>海风吹拂的守塔人旧居外侧青石晒盐台上，<</if>>一只用来防风压帆布的空心石滚磙侧面露出一道铜合页，旁边的木架上搁着一柄木槌与一罐润滑鱼油。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_12 is 1>>
晒盐台上的空心石滚磙今日已开启查验，海风里带着淡淡盐香。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-12">
<<investigateicon>><<link "敲松合页 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-12">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_12 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_12_rew")>><<money 350>>铜合页应声松开，石磙空腔里滚出一只装着守塔人私房银币的油皮袋。<<else>>石滚磙内腔干燥无水，你顺手将铜合页扣回原位。<</if>><span class="green">你解开了晒盐台空心石滚磙的隐藏合页。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石磙表面凝着一层粗盐粒，木槌敲击时滑了一下。<span class="red">你扫去石面粗盐粒定下神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "滴油润合页 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-12">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_12 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>鱼油顺着销钉渗入，铜盖悄无声息地掀开，露出一叠完好的灯塔补给兑换券。<<else>>合页销钉润泽顺滑，再无半点干涩锈响。<</if>><span class="green">你用鱼油润销法无声开启了石磙暗格。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海风吹凉了鱼油，第一滴落在合页外侧。<span class="red">你用布角将油滴擦进缝隙。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨拍打着断桅沉船滩半埋沙中的铁锚爪，<<else>>湿沙上的断桅沉船滩铁锚爪旁，<</if>>退潮冲刷出的锚柄横杆下压着一只缠满铜丝的防水柚木盒，沙地上散落着一把剪线钳与一块磨刀青石。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_13 is 1>>
断桅沉船滩铁锚爪下的柚木盒今日已取走，海浪轻拍沙岸。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-13">
<<sneakicon>><<link "剪断铜丝 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-13">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_13_rew")>><<money 360>>铜丝铮然断开，柚木盒里整齐码放着早年商船留下的压舱银元。<<else>>柚木盒木质紧密，里面的防潮油纸依然干爽如新。<</if>><span class="green">你利落地解开了铁锚爪下的柚木盒铜丝。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜丝拧成了三股麻花扣，钳口第一次没能咬断。<span class="red">你换到铜丝单股处重新下钳。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "垫石抽木盒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-foghorn-13">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_13_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>锚柄抬起一寸，你连盒带铜丝完整抽出，在盒底夹层还多摸出几枚古鎏金徽章。<<else>>青石稳稳托住沉重锚柄，抽盒过程干净利落。<</if>><span class="green">你借青石支点毫不费力地取出了整只柚木盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	湿沙在青石下陷了半寸，锚柄还没抬到位。<span class="red">你扒开浮沙把青石垫在硬礁上。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜潮在海蚀回音廊的石拱穹顶下激起轰鸣，<<else>>平潮期的海蚀回音廊石拱下水声清越，<</if>>石壁第三处共鸣风龛内挂着一只随风摆动的青铜测风铃，铃舌上方卡着一枚防水锡囊，龛边石槽里放着一根长竹竿与一团软麻絮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc5 is 1>>
回音廊风龛内的青铜测风铃今日已取下锡囊，铃声清亮悠远。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "挑落锡囊 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_enc5_rew")>><<money 370>>防水锡囊稳稳落入你空着的掌心，里面装着守塔人记下的暗流赏金券。<<else>>测风铃恢复了清脆鸣响，顺着海风传遍整条回音廊。<</if>><span class="green">你精准挑落了共鸣风龛里的防水锡囊。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	穿堂海风吹偏了竹竿梢头，擦过铜铃边缘。<span class="red">你双脚分开站稳重心。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "塞铃口解锡囊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_enc5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>铜铃未发半点声响，你从容解下锡囊，还在龛角摸出了前人藏起的零钱袋。<<else>>软麻絮完美吸去了金属震动，你的手法轻巧得如同海鸟掠波。<</if>><span class="green">你以消音巧技悄无声息地取下了风龛锡囊。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风龛位置略高，踮起脚尖时麻絮还没塞严。<span class="red">你踩上一级凸石借力。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨幕笼罩着雾角灯塔底座的备用储油石窖口，<<else>>海风清爽的雾角灯塔底座备用储油石窖前，<</if>>石窖铁门下方的通风百叶格里卡着一只打着铅封的黄铜油量尺盒，门旁工具箱里留着一把十字改锥与一块擦油毡布。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc6 is 1>>
储油石窖铁门通风百叶下的黄铜尺盒今日已查验妥当。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "卸百叶取盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-6">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_enc6_rew")>><<money 380>>百叶格顺利卸下，黄铜尺盒里除了油量标尺还夹着一卷结余的灯油津贴银币。<<else>>你将通风百叶格原样装回，螺丝拧得严丝合缝。<</if>><span class="green">你取出了储油石窖通风口里的黄铜尺盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	海雾锈蚀了最下面一颗螺丝，改锥尖滑了一下。<span class="red">你用擦油毡布抹去螺丝浮锈。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "裹布抽尺盒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-foghorn-6">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_foghorn_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_foghorn_enc6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>叶片微微张开，尺盒毫发无损地滑进毡布里，你顺带收下了盒底的保养纪念铜章。<<else>>毡布隔开了锋利的金属叶片，双手干干净净。<</if>><span class="green">你无需拆门便巧妙抽出了通风百叶里的尺盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	百叶格内侧卡着一点干海草，挡住了尺盒边角。<span class="red">你先将干海草拨到一旁。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜的机括城青铜齿轮回廊灯火幽微，<<else>>机括城青铜齿轮回廊的第三座分动箱前，<</if>>分动箱侧面的透明油窗后浮着一只密封的红铜胶囊筒，箱台边缘放着一把弯头镊子与一只虹吸橡胶球。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_clockwork_11 is 1>>
第三座分动箱油窗后的红铜胶囊筒今日已取出核验。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-clockwork-11">
<<investigateicon>><<link "夹出胶囊筒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-clockwork-11">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_clockwork_11 to 1>>
