:: MP Region Moment Glasshouse 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色下的夜光标本廊泛着幽幽蓝绿荧光，<<else>>恒温幽静的夜光标本廊八号展台前，<</if>>盛放夜光蝶标本的八角玻璃罩底座下压着一封烫金植物图谱信，展台抽屉边放着一块鹿皮擦镜布与一柄黄铜起钉器。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_12 is 1>>
夜光标本廊八号展台下的烫金图谱信今日已取阅完毕。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-12">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抬起玻璃罩 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-12">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_12 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_12_rew")>><<money 350>>玻璃罩底座平稳抬起半寸，你抽出烫金图谱信，收下了内附的标本采集津贴。<<else>>八角玻璃罩稳稳落回绒垫，夜光蝶翅在暗处熠熠生辉。<</if>><span class="green">你平稳抬起标本玻璃罩取出了烫金图谱信。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	底座四角粘着防滑蜂蜡，起钉器第一次没能撬动。<span class="red">你换到蜂蜡较薄的东南角下手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "托底平推取信 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-12">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_12 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_12_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>玻璃罩顺着鹿皮布平滑移开，你取出图谱信与底座暗格里的双份花会信物铜章。<<else>>擦镜布顺带抹净了展台浮尘，玻璃罩透亮如新。<</if>><span class="green">你借鹿皮布滑轨法完好取出了展台底信。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鹿皮布折得略厚，塞入滑轨时卡了一下。<span class="red">你将鹿皮布单层展平重新塞入。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Glasshouse 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨滴在玻璃穹顶露台的铸铁天窗外汇成水线，<<else>>暖雾未散的玻璃穹顶露台汉白玉花柱旁，<</if>>控制天窗开合的黄铜手轮齿轮箱下方卡着一只丝绒茶会请柬袋，花柱石座上放着一把小油刷与一根铜制拨针。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_13 is 1>>
玻璃穹顶露台手轮箱下的丝绒请柬袋今日已取出。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-13">
<<tendingicon>><<link "润手轮取请柬 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-13">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_13_rew")>><<money 360>>手轮轻快转过半圈，丝绒请柬袋完好滑出，里面夹着名流茶会的伴手礼金券。<<else>>天窗开合齿轮得到了充分润滑，运转得悄无声息。<</if>><span class="green">你润滑天窗手轮后完好取出了丝绒请柬袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	齿轮齿根积着一点干花瓣屑，油刷刷过时顿了一下。<span class="red">你先把干花瓣屑挑干净。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "挑开检修活门 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-glasshouse-13">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_13_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>检修活门应声弹开，你直接取出丝绒请柬袋，还拿到了箱底预留的修缮纪念铜章。<<else>>丝绒袋上的金线刺绣分毫无损，散发出淡雅的伯爵茶香。<</if>><span class="green">你从齿轮箱检修活门直接取出了丝绒请柬袋。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	检修活门的内簧略紧，铜拨针尖端滑了半寸。<span class="red">你抵住内簧根部稳稳发力。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜间的地下酿造室弥漫着馥郁的冷浸花露香，<<else>>恒温微凉的地下酿造室三号蒸馏铜釜旁，<</if>>铜釜底部的冷凝螺旋管托架下压着一只铅封玻璃样品匣，操作台上摆着一盆冰水与一把包胶扁嘴钳。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc5 is 1>>
三号蒸馏铜釜下的铅封玻璃样品匣今日已查验完毕。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-5">
<<tendingicon>><<link "降温取木匣 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_enc5_rew")>><<money 370>>螺旋管遇冷微缩，你用包胶钳稳稳夹出样品匣，收下了里面的调香师试饮津贴。<<else>>包胶钳口严密护住玻璃匣壁，连一道划痕也未留下。<</if>><span class="green">你借温差收缩法安全取出了铅封样品匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰水泼洒得稍快，铜管表面起了一层滑手的水珠。<span class="red">你拿干毛巾擦去管壁水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "松螺母抽匣 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_enc5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>蝶形螺母应手旋松，你轻松抽出玻璃样品匣，连同底衬下的秘酿纪念信物券一并收好。<<else>>旋紧蝶形螺母后托架稳固如初，蒸馏铜釜继续安静滴露。<</if>><span class="green">你旋松托架蝶形螺母完好抽出了玻璃样品匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蝶形螺母双耳沾了一点蜂蜡，拧动时有些打滑。<span class="red">你用指甲刮去螺母上的浮蜡。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>地面雨声隐隐传入地下酿造室最深处的酒架区，<<else>>地下酿造室最深处的陈年花露橡木桶架前，<</if>>第七只橡木桶的黄铜龙头下方挂着一只打着双环锁的锡制酒牌盒，架边挂着一柄木制酒槌与一串编号铜签。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回秘密温室 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc6 is 1>>
第七只橡木桶下的锡制酒牌盒今日已核验开启。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "对签开双锁 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-6">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_enc6_rew")>><<money 380>>双环锁应声弹开，锡制酒牌盒里放着一张未兑付的酒庄特供银票。<<else>>你将编号铜签按年份重新排齐，酒架显得井然有序。<</if>><span class="green">你按铜签年份解开了橡木桶下的锡制酒牌盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	酿造室光线微暗，铜签上的小字看差了一位。<span class="red">你凑近壁灯重新核对年份尾数。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "叩桶箍取酒牌 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-glasshouse-6">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11300>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_glasshouse_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_glasshouse_enc6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>桶箍微震间挂钩自动脱开，酒牌盒落入你掌心，里面还多出一袋窖藏保管费。<<else>>浑厚的叩击声顺带测出了桶内花露存量，可谓一举两得。<</if>><span class="green">你用酒槌叩击法巧手取下了锡制酒牌盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	第一槌敲在桶腹厚木板处，震动没能传到龙头挂钩。<span class="red">你改向靠近龙头的第二道铁箍轻叩。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Glasshouse 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Region Moment Blackiron 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨冲刷着黑铁货运站调车场五号道岔的枕木，<<else>>枕木间的黑铁货运站调车场五号道岔旁，<</if>>道岔转辙器铸铁箱的侧盖缝隙里夹着一只防水帆布票夹，道碴边放着一把长柄撬棍与一罐重机油。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_blackiron_11 is 1>>
五号道岔转辙器箱内的防水帆布票夹今日已取出。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-11">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬出帆布夹 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-11">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_blackiron_11 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_blackiron_11_rew")>><<money 340>>铸铁侧盖抬起一寸，你抽出防水帆布票夹，收下了里面夹着的调车津贴银币。<<else>>转辙器侧盖重新扣严，道岔扳动顺畅自如。<</if>><span class="green">你撬开五号道岔转辙器侧盖取出了帆布票夹。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 12]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	雨水打湿了铸铁箱边沿，撬棍尖端滑开了半寸。<span class="red">你用鞋底踩住撬棍支点。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "注油推箱盖 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-11">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_blackiron_11 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_blackiron_11_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>重机油润透滑槽，侧盖无声滑开，你取出票夹并在箱底摸出了一笔夜班调度补贴。<<else>>转辙器齿轮顺带得到了润滑，扳动时省力了不少。<</if>><span class="green">你用重机油润槽法轻松打开了转辙器侧盖。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	重机油在低温下略有些稠，流进滑槽的速度稍慢。<span class="red">你用细铁丝顺着槽口引流机油。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 11]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Blackiron 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "elk">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜色下的三号装甲货车厢内部幽暗冷峻，<<else>>三号装甲货车厢中段的备用工具挂架前，<</if>>铆接钢板壁的检修活门后卡着一只铁皮押运日志盒，挂架上挂着一把六角套筒扳手与一面折叠反光镜。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回黑铁货站 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_blackiron_12 is 1>>
三号装甲货车检修活门后的押运日志盒今日已查验完毕。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Blackiron 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-12">
<<investigateicon>><<link "卸螺栓取盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-blackiron-12">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
