<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_13_rew")>><<money 370>>橡胶锤轻柔震开暗扣，平衡铅块槽滑出半寸，你取出了黄铜封蜡匣里的标本收购银币。<<else>>鹦鹉螺化石纹丝未动，展座严丝合缝地合拢如初。<</if>><span class="green">你用橡胶小锤震开暗扣取出了展座下的封蜡匣。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	展座木质厚实，第一下轻叩力道稍轻。<span class="red">你对准底座侧面的榫眼位置再叩。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拨开铅块卡簧 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-moment-observatory-13">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_13 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_13_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>铜规精准拨开卡簧，黄铜封蜡匣连同底部的学园研究基贵宾铜牌一同滑入你掌心。<<else>>细长铜规与导孔完美契合，不留一丝撬痕。<</if>><span class="green">你用细长铜规精准拨开卡簧取出了黄铜封蜡匣。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	导孔内部有一道折角，铜规直插时碰到了孔壁。<span class="red">你将铜规微弯十五度顺折角探入。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 13]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Observatory 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>晚风穿过旧学园天文翼楼的钟楼连廊石拱，<<else>>天光开阔的旧学园天文翼楼钟楼连廊中段，<</if>>连廊扶手石柱顶端的青铜日晷座下卡着一只防水油纸信封，柱旁工具匣里放着一枚水准泡仪与一把薄刃刮刀。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc5 is 1>>
钟楼连廊青铜日晷座下的防水油纸信封今日已取走。
<br>
<<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-5">
<<investigateicon>><<link "刮泥取信封 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-5">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_enc5_rew")>><<money 380>>老化封泥应声剥落，你从日晷座下抽出防水油纸信封，收下了里面的校舍修缮津贴。<<else>>你将日晷座重新放平，晷针投影分毫不差。<</if>><span class="green">你剃去老化封泥顺利取出了日晷座下的油纸信封。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	连廊高处风急，吹得刮刀尖端偏了半毫米。<span class="red">你侧身挡住穿堂风稳住手腕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "调平日晷座 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_enc5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>水准气泡居中瞬间底扣自动弹开，你取出油纸信封，还收下了附带的精密测量纪念铜章。<<else>>水准调校后的青铜日晷比先前更加精准，令人赏心悦目。<</if>><span class="green">你借水准泡仪调平法完美开启了青铜日晷底座。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<skulduggery 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石柱表面微有倾角，气泡还偏在刻度圈外半格。<span class="red">你在底座北侧垫入一片薄铜片。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 5]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Observatory 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>风雨吹动着钟楼连廊尽头的四杯式青铜风速计，<<else>>钟楼连廊尽头与旧钟塔交接的测风石台前，<</if>>风速计记数齿轮箱下方的防雨铜罩里藏着一只密封的铁皮津贴盒，石台凹槽里放着一把止动木楔与一罐石墨润滑粉。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc6 is 1>>
钟楼连廊尽头风速计铜罩里的铁皮津贴盒今日已查验完毕。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "楔住风杯旋罩 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-6">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_enc6_rew")>><<money 390>>风杯稳稳停转，你旋开防雨铜罩取出铁皮津贴盒，收下了里面的高空观测津贴。<<else>>取下止动木楔后四只风杯迎风欢快旋转，记数齿轮滴答作响。<</if>><span class="green">你制动风速计转轴后安全取出了防雨铜罩内的津贴盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	高处阵风吹得风杯转速颇快，木楔第一次没能卡入。<span class="red">你看准阵风减弱的间隙迅速推入木楔。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "撒粉滑出铁盒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-region-encounter-observatory-6">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg5_observatory_enc6 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg5_observatory_enc6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>石墨粉让铜罩滑轨顺畅无比，铁皮信物铜牌盒连同底部的气象记录特别纪念铜章一并滑入你手中。<<else>>石墨干粉既不沾灰又耐严寒，风速计运转得愈发灵敏。<</if>><span class="green">你用石墨润滑法在不暂停风杯的情况下取出了信物铜牌盒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<history 1>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	连廊横风吹散了一半石墨粉，滑轨还没润透。<span class="red">你用掌心拢成风罩对准滑轨吹粉。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
<br>
<<link [[深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

